{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Immortal Hero Lost in the Past</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a Hero who has lost his memory falls into a world of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though he wields tremendous power, he cannot recall who he once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, the weapon in his hand is strangely familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, he must press forward to uncover the reason he arrived in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/01.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>The Hero Who Grows Stronger with Every Death</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hero's journey in this world is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formidable enemies block his path, yet with every death, the Hero grows even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering his controls through repeated challenges and harnessing new powers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">he is destined to become the savior of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/02.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>An Unbelievable Ally: The Jar with a Gigantic Mouth</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious Jar guides his path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems to know everything, though its purpose remains elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nonetheless, it proves to be a steadfast companion in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But will following its guidance truly lead to salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/03.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>In Pursuit of the World's Secrets with a Witch</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Witch has bestowed upon the Hero unexpected immortal power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time the Hero dies, she grants him even greater strength,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">gradually revealing the hidden truths of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, as you listen to the tales of the Jar and the Witch,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you begin to realize that this world is far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/04.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of this world rests on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What should you believe in here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure and witness the truth with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decision may determine the destiny of this world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3150580?t=1740667413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/f213cbb67bdb6481e60199788bbd9ebfb9a5f439/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740667413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/4a5edc7a00e920399109b7a93312099ec2d488fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740667413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/4a5edc7a00e920399109b7a93312099ec2d488fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740667413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Immortal Hero Lost in the Past</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a Hero who has lost his memory falls into a world of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though he wields tremendous power, he cannot recall who he once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, the weapon in his hand is strangely familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, he must press forward to uncover the reason he arrived in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/01.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>The Hero Who Grows Stronger with Every Death</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hero's journey in this world is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formidable enemies block his path, yet with every death, the Hero grows even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering his controls through repeated challenges and harnessing new powers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">he is destined to become the savior of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/02.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>An Unbelievable Ally: The Jar with a Gigantic Mouth</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious Jar guides his path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems to know everything, though its purpose remains elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nonetheless, it proves to be a steadfast companion in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But will following its guidance truly lead to salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/03.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>In Pursuit of the World's Secrets with a Witch</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Witch has bestowed upon the Hero unexpected immortal power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time the Hero dies, she grants him even greater strength,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">gradually revealing the hidden truths of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, as you listen to the tales of the Jar and the Witch,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you begin to realize that this world is far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/extras/04.gif?t=1740667413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of this world rests on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What should you believe in here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure and witness the truth with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decision may determine the destiny of this world.</p>","developers":["IF Moon Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2530600","name":"RIM:Soul Jar"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150580/header.jpg?t=1740667413","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101738,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101738/movie480.mp4?t=1740410307","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101738/movie_max.mp4?t=1740410307"},"name":"Rim Soul Jar Demo V0.3 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101738/169f8ee71fec2b4fdfdbb0ef89d3e018f7d03c2f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740410307","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101738/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740410307","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101738/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740410307"}}]